+New tests remain allowed. This is mechanical anti-weakening evidence requiring independent review,
+not behavioral proof.
+Independent correctness/security review remains required.
+
+## Verdict
+
+Pending Phase 1. This document must end with either **discard Phase 1** or **recommend a separately
